# Game loop architecture (pointer)

Full law: [`docs/docs/architecture/game-loop.md`](../../docs/docs/architecture/game-loop.md).

**Permanent decision:** A Station owns its Hab + Hangar. Hab/Hangar are
per-player instances (placeable build; team follow-in). On foot: Hab ↔ Station
(`scene-exit`) → AVMS call ship / To Hangar → Hangar. Ships: Open Space
**`enter-station`** → Hangar; Hangar **`exit-hangar`** → station nested
`hangar-open-space-exit` in Open Space. Session start:
[Scene flow](../../docs/docs/architecture/scene-flow.md). Instance / peer truth:
[Multiplayer](../../docs/docs/architecture/multiplayer.md). Open Space boarding:
[Space traversal](../../docs/docs/architecture/space-traversal.md).

When changing station/hab/hangar/AVMS/`scene-exit`/boarding flow, read the full
doc first. Also listed in `AGENTS.md`.
